  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niue 2023 Short Term Scholarships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to increase the knowledge and skills of individuals so that they can contribute to the development of Niue and positively impact the bilateral relationship by providing short term scholarships (less than one year in length) to scholars from Niue. These short term scholarships can take the form of vocational training, an apprenticeship, or other workplace experience.</narrative>
  </description>
